→ External MinIO
→ Isolated restore
→ Integrity validation
end note

' ============================================================
' CURRENT / FUTURE BOUNDARY
' ============================================================

legend bottom
  |= <b>STATUS</b> |= <b>ARCHITECTURE</b> |
  | <#DCFCE7> CURRENT | Deployed / implemented platform capability |
  | <#FEF3C7> VERIFIED | Backup / recovery capability with runtime evidence |
  | <#FFEDD5> AVAILABLE | Dedicated AI infrastructure, not production matching |
  | <#F1F5F9> OUT OF CURRENT MAP | RAG · MCP · Qdrant · Keycloak · Vault integration · Kafka · Lakehouse · React frontend |
endlegend

@enduml